### 1. 先添加一个专业
POST http://localhost:8080/major/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "majorCode": "CS01",
  "majorName": "计算机科学与技术",
  "planInside": 30,
  "planOutside": 5
}

### 2. 再添加一个考生（该专业下）
POST http://localhost:8080/student/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "examId": "2024001",
  "name": "张三",
  "gender": "男",
  "age": 22,
  "political": "共青团员",
  "isFresh": 1,
  "education": "本科",
  "source": "大连民族大学",
  "majorCode": "CS01",
  "type": "全日制"
}

### 3. 测试删除专业（应该报错）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/major/delete/CS01